WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.748
Tomorrow, I'm going to a garage sale.

2
00:00:10.749 --> 00:00:14.043
Do you know what a garage sale is?

3
00:00:14.044 --> 00:00:18.228
Why don't you come with me?

4
00:00:18.229 --> 00:00:21.186
Hana: What are we doing tomorrow?

5
00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:24.272
Sunny: We're going to a garage sale.

6
00:00:24.273 --> 00:00:26.335
Bada: What's that?

7
00:00:26.336 --> 00:00:30.128
Mom: Let's find out.

8
00:00:30.129 --> 00:00:38.364
Sunny: At garage sales, people sell things they don't need or want anymore.

9
00:00:38.365 --> 00:00:40.390
Mom: How much is this?

10
00:00:40.391 --> 00:00:44.561
Woman: Oh, that's fifty cents.

11
00:00:44.562 --> 00:00:46.592
Hana: What's that?

12
00:00:46.593 --> 00:00:50.653
Woman: That's a record player. Listen.

13
00:00:50.654 --> 00:00:57.675
Hana & Bada: Wow! What are these?

14
00:00:57.676 --> 00:01:00.123
Woman: These are cookie cutters.

15
00:01:00.124 --> 00:01:03.230
You can make cookies in these shapes.

16
00:01:03.231 --> 00:01:05.503
Hana: How much are they?

17
00:01:05.504 --> 00:01:08.464
Woman: Ten cents each.

18
00:01:08.465 --> 00:01:10.929
Bada: I like this!

19
00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:13.357
Woman: It used to be my son's.

20
00:01:13.358 --> 00:01:15.659
You can have it for free!

21
00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:18.127
Bada: Thank you very much!

22
00:01:18.128 --> 00:01:20.856
Woman : You're welcome!

23
00:01:20.857 --> 00:01:23.825
Bada: Look what she gave me!

24
00:01:23.826 --> 00:01:25.774
Hana: Look what I got!

25
00:01:25.775 --> 00:01:30.145
Mom: Oh, you can make cookies now.

26
00:01:30.146 --> 00:01:35.205
In America, people don't just throw away things.

27
00:01:35.206 --> 00:01:37.736
Other people may want them.

28
00:01:37.737 --> 00:01:41.305
Instead, they have garage sales.

29
00:01:41.306 --> 00:01:52.256
Garage sales are lots of fun!
